D%3D%3D%27%5D%27%7C%7Cvalue%3D%3D%3D%27%29%27%29%7B%0A%20%20%20if%28value%21%3D%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28stack%2Cstack.length-1%29%29throw%20new%20TypeError%28%27unbalanced%20Rust%20project%20source%20group%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20stack.pop%28%29%3Bif%28stack.length%3D%3D%3D0%29return%20position%2B1%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%7D%0A%20throw%20new%20TypeError%28%27unclosed%20Rust%20project%20source%20group%27%29%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Five%20Number%20columns%20per%20actual%20module%3A%20keyword%2C%20name%2C%20delimiter%2C%20after%2C%0A%20%2A%20parent%20record.%20Nongrammatical%20owner%20bodies%20and%20macro%20inputs%20are%20skipped%20as%0A%20%2A%20complete%20groups%2C%20so%20their%20text%20cannot%20invent%20a%20module%20declaration.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20kinds%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20values%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readRustProjectModulePlan%28kinds%2Cvalues%29%7B%0A%20if%28kinds.length%21%3D%3Dvalues.length%29throw%20new%20TypeError%28%27unaligned%20Rust%20project%20token%20columns%27%29%3B%0A%20const%20plan%3D%5B%5D%2Cparents%3D%5B%5D%2Ccloses%3D%5B%5D%3Blet%20position%3D0%2Cparent%3D-1%3B%0A%20while%28position%3Cvalues.length%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20kind%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Cposition%29%2Cvalue%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Cposition%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28closes.length%3E0%26%26position%3D%3D%3DreadRequiredNumberFact%28closes%2Ccloses.length-1%29%29%7Bcloses.pop%28%29%3Bparent%3DreadRequiredNumberFact%28parents%2Cparents.length-1%29%3Bparents.pop%28%29%3Bposition%2B%3D1%3Bcontinue%3B%7D%0A%20%20if%28kind%3D%3D%3D%27keyword%27%26%26value%3D%3D%3D%27mod%27%29%7B%0A%20%20%20if%28position%2B2%3E%3Dvalues.length%7C%7CreadRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Cposition%2B1%29%21%3D%3D%27identifier%27%29throw%20new%20TypeError%28%27invalid%20Rust%20project%20module%20name%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20const%20delimiter%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Cposition%2B2%29%3B%0A%20%20%20if%28readRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Cpositio